			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150420101,
					"content": "Woohoo!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420102,
					"content": "Sunshine, waves, and koholasaurs!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420103,
					"content": "Aaand the minute she sees the water, it's like the rest of us don't exist. Paimon thought \"Umo{RUBY#[S]Unity}ja\" meant no person left behind...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420104,
					"content": "Quick, this way! C'mon guys, stop lollygagging... Let's go!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420105,
					"content": "Oh! Coming, coming!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420106,
					"content": "Look, tell me what you see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420107,
					"content": "A wooden plank.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420108,
					"content": "Not just any old wooden plank. Read what it says!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420109,
					"content": "Ohhh, it's a sightseeing map.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420110,
					"content": "Exactly! This map is as precious as a key to a vault of untold treasures...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420111,
					"content": "Yeah, I see that! It's like a call to adventure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420112,
					"content": "Yes! Or, like a burning ember of phlogiston!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420113,
					"content": "Phlogiston? Oh... That's a type of energy, isn't it? So, is a map like phlogiston because... just a little spark is enough to light a fire under someone?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420114,
					"content": "Exactly! And just like phlogiston, a map is super important!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420115,
					"content": "With a map to guide your way, you're free to carve out your very own path of adventure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420116,
					"content": "Hehe, freedom and adventure! I like the sound of that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420117,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420118,
					"content": "Whoa, whoa, hold your horses, folks... Why does Paimon feel like Mualani's hiding something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420119,
					"content": "Alright, everyone, time for solo exploration!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420120,
					"content": "Wait, what kind of tour guide calls it quits the minute we get to the part where we're supposed to, y'know... TOUR!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420121,
						150420122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420121,
					"content": "Maybe Mualani just wants to go off on her own?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150420123,
					"content": "Hehe, spoken like a true friend. I won't forget that you had my back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420124,
					"content": "Here, just take a look. These two major attractions have been marked \"Under Testing.\" My guess is that they've run into some issues.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420125,
					"content": "So, if we split up, we all get to check out the attractions we're interested in, and we can help out with the testing at the same time! Maybe we'll even get Wavey Bay up and running sooner than expected!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420126,
					"content": "Oh, so you were looking out for the group the whole time... Sorry. Paimon thought you were just obsessing over water activities...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420127,
					"content": "Hehe, don't sweat it. Why don't we regroup near that giant koholasaur building when we're done?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420128,
					"content": "Based on the guiding experience I've racked up over the years, my gut tells me the entrance to the main challenge should be somewhere around there!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420129,
					"content": "Sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420130,
					"content": "Alright then, let's split up. Don't forget to keep checking the map!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150420122,
					"content": "Even a \"guide\" deserves a vacation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150420123
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1504213,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
