			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150421501,
					"content": "Great, let's do a headcount. One, two, three, four...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421502,
					"content": "Huh, that's one more than before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421503,
					"content": "Oh, hello! I'm guessing you're here to take on the main challenge at Wavey Bay? Unfortunately, we've run into a bit of a problem...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421504,
					"content": "But, um... Here, I can still take a group photo for you if you need one for your album...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421505,
					"content": "No... That's not how it's supposed to go!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421506,
					"content": "Photos are just a way to preserve memories, something to look back on and remember all the happy moments. What matters to us is the actual experience itself!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421507,
					"content": "Well, these particular photos can be exchanged for prizes, but... Yeah, okay, you're right. Just snapping a photo and rushing off wouldn't feel right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421508,
					"content": "I understand, and I'm very sorry about this. Please bear with us a little longer, we'll do our best to resolve the issue as soon as possible...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421509,
					"content": "How long do you think it'll be?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421510,
					"content": "That's hard to say...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421511,
					"content": "Oh, why's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421512,
					"content": "Can we do anything to help?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421513,
					"content": "Um...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421514,
					"content": "I noticed you don't have a lot of staff working on the other attractions in Wavey Bay, and the saurian employees seem pretty tired out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421515,
					"content": "I'm guessing it's because the main attraction ran into trouble, so everyone was temporarily reassigned to help with the repair work?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421516,
					"content": "Relax, I get there are probably things you can't disclose. I'm not trying to make things harder for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421517,
					"content": "In fact, I might be able to make your life easier. My companions are all very capable and happy to help out. They just finished testing Twilight Cruise and Asha Speedrun.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421518,
					"content": "If you told us what the issue was, I bet we could help you solve it in no time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421519,
					"content": "Wow, what a tactful negotiator! Guess that's the hidden power of a Peacemaker...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421520,
					"content": "Wait, Chasca... How did you notice all that? You weren't spying on us from up in some treetop somewhere, were you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421521,
					"content": "Does that really matter right now...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421522,
					"content": "What matters... is that we're really good helpers! So, if there's a problem, we're more than happy to do our part to fix it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421523,
					"content": "Well, your observations were right, down to the detail about our saurians... I'm sorry, I shouldn't have tried to hide anything from you all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421524,
					"content": "So basically...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421525,
					"content": "During testing, we realized that the Razzle-Dazzle Mega Slide's current paint job still leaves a LOT to be desired. Since it has to be sprayed from the Spiritway, it's a formidable challenge, to say the least.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421526,
					"content": "To avoid delaying the resort's official opening, we had to temporarily shut it down. Right now, we're working around the clock to get it completed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421527,
					"content": "Haha... You call that a challenge?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421528,
					"content": "Tell me where the paint is, and I'll get it done in one go!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421529,
					"content": "Huh? But... I don't see how you could possibly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421530,
					"content": "Ah, that's because you've never met her before. This is \"Umo{RUBY#[S]Unity}ja\" Mualani.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421531,
					"content": "Mualani... Wait a sec, THE Mualani!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150421532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				},
				{
					"id": 150421532,
					"content": "You mean... one of the six heroes? THAT Mualani!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Tuksina"
				}
			]
		},
